{"id": 12765, "title": "Order takeaway", "level": "Beginner", "hsk_tags": ["HSK2"], "slug": "order-takeaway", "audio_url": "/audio/mandarin/12765_order-takeaway.mp3", "simplified_paragraphs": ["我是一名医生，工作很忙。我不会做饭，一般也不在家里吃，下班以后经常去医院旁边的饭馆吃饭。后来，同事们告诉我，可以用手机点外卖，又方便又便宜。我试了一个星期，感觉太好了。我现在每顿都可以吃不同的东西，昨天吃饺子，今天吃面条，明天吃三明治，太幸福了！"], "traditional_paragraphs": ["我是一名醫生，工作很忙。我不會做飯，一般也不在家裡吃，下班以後經常去醫院旁邊的飯館吃飯。後來，同事們告訴我，可以用手機點外賣，又方便又便宜。我試了一個星期，感覺太好了。我現在每頓都可以吃不同的東西，昨天吃餃子，今天吃麵條，明天吃三明治，太幸福了！"], "pinyin_paragraphs": ["wǒ shì yī míng yī shēng， gōng zuò hěn máng。 wǒ bù huì zuò fàn， yī bān yě bù zài jiā lǐ chī， xià bān yǐ hòu jīng cháng qù yī yuàn páng biān de fàn guǎn chī fàn。 hòu lái， tóng shì men gào su wǒ， kě yǐ yòng shǒu jī diǎn wài mài， yòu fāng biàn yòu pián yi。 wǒ shì le yī gè xīng qī， gǎn jué tài hǎo le。 wǒ xiàn zài měi dùn dōu kě yǐ chī bù tóng de dōng xi， zuó tiān chī jiǎo zi， jīn tiān chī miàn tiáo， míng tiān chī sān míng zhì， tài xìng fú le！"], "english_paragraphs": ["I am a doctor and very busy at work. I don't know how to cook, and I usually don't eat at home. After get off work, I often go to the restaurant next to the hospital to eat. Later, my colleagues told me that I could order takeout using my mobile phone, which was convenient and cheap. I tried it for a week and it felt great. I can now eat different things for every meal. Yesterday I had dumplings, today I have noodles, and tomorrow I have sandwiches. I’m so happy!"], "english_full": "I am a doctor and very busy at work. I don't know how to cook, and I usually don't eat at home. After get off work, I often go to the restaurant next to the hospital to eat. Later, my colleagues told me that I could order takeout using my mobile phone, which was convenient and cheap. I tried it for a week and it felt great. I can now eat different things for every meal. Yesterday I had dumplings, today I have noodles, and tomorrow I have sandwiches. I’m so happy!", "ruby_paragraphs": ["<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"wǒ\" data-defn=\